{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","is_bot":false,"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","name":"彭于晏"},"body":"## BUG: Dependency Confusion\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nInternal package name exists on public npm/PyPI — attacker can upload a higher-version malicious package\n\n### Goal\nSubmit fix code to patch this security vulnerability.\n\n### How to Submit\n1. Post your fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHoa0Q","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #39\n\nI can get this done. Going through the codebase now — the issue looks clear enough. I'll put up a pull request shortly after I've validated the fix.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:22:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4839840465","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHocYQ","author":{"login":"Zubi-fix"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #39\n\nI can take this on. Going through the repo structure now and mapping out what needs to change. I'll push a PR when I'm confident the fix is clean and doesn't break anything else.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:22:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4839840865","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHqthg","author":{"login":"zhumin110cs122"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this bounty. I have relevant experience and can deliver quality results. Let me know if there are any specific requirements!","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:30:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4839878022","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIYhug","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782801851512","createdAt":"2026-06-30T06:44:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840628666","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIZFMw","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: jhaayushkumar\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T06:45:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840637747","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIaI3A","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782802112851","createdAt":"2026-06-30T06:48:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840655068","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIaoQg","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: jhaayushkumar\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T06:49:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840663106","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIcTpw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782802440108","createdAt":"2026-06-30T06:54:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840690599","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIc8gQ","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: jhaayushkumar\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T06:55:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840701057","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIi-KQ","author":{"login":"jhaayushkumar"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"\n⭐ I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.\n已为上游仓库加星：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research （账号：jhaayushkumar）","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:10:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840799785","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIjj6Q","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782803499973","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:11:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840809449","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIkXUw","author":{"login":"jhaayushkumar"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"⭐ I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.\n已为上游仓库加星：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research （账号：jhaayushkumar）\n\nTesting dependency confusion fix submission:\n\n```python\nimport re\nimport sys\nfrom typing import Tuple\n\nclass DependencyConfusionProtector:\n    def __init__(self, private_registry=None, internal_namespaces=None):\n        self.private_registry = private_registry\n        self.internal_namespaces = internal_namespaces or []\n    \n    def is_internal_package(self, package_name):\n        if not self.internal_namespaces:\n            return False\n        package_lower = package_name.lower()\n        return any(package_lower.startswith(ns.lower()) for ns in self.internal_namespaces)\n    \n    def validate_version_constraint(self, package_name, version):\n        version_match = re.match(r'(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)', version)\n        if not version_match:\n            return False, \"Invalid format\"\n        major, minor, patch = map(int, version_match.groups())\n        if major >= 99 or minor >= 99:\n            return False, \"Suspicious version detected - possible dependency confusion attack\"\n        return True, \"Version validated\"\n    \n    def validate_package_source(self, package_name, source_url=None):\n        is_internal = self.is_internal_package(package_name)\n        if is_internal:\n            if not self.private_registry:\n                return False, \"No private registry configured\"\n            if source_url and self.private_registry not in source_url:\n                return False, \"Internal package from unauthorized source\"\n            return True, \"Authorized private registry\"\n        return True, \"Public package validated\"\n    \n    def generate_secure_pip_command(self, packages):\n        cmd = [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\"]\n        if self.private_registry:\n            cmd.extend([\"--index-url\", self.private_registry, \"--no-index\"])\n        cmd.extend(packages)\n        cmd.extend([\"--require-hashes\", \"--no-deps\"])\n        return cmd\n\ndef detect_dependency_confusion_attack(package_name, installed_version, expected_source):\n    alerts = []\n    risk_score = 0\n    version_match = re.match(r'(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)', installed_version)\n    if version_match:\n        major, minor, patch = map(int, version_match.groups())\n        if major >= 99:\n            alerts.append(f\"Major version {major} is suspiciously high\")\n            risk_score += 50\n        if minor >= 99:\n            alerts.append(f\"Minor version {minor} is suspiciously high\")\n            risk_score += 30\n    return {\n        \"package_name\": package_name,\n        \"version\": installed_version,\n        \"alerts\": alerts,\n        \"risk_score\": risk_score,\n        \"is_suspicious\": risk_score >= 50,\n        \"recommendation\": \"BLOCK AND INVESTIGATE\" if risk_score >= 50 else \"MONITOR\"\n    }\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    protector = DependencyConfusionProtector(\n        private_registry=\"https://artifacts.mycompany.com/pypi\",\n        internal_namespaces=[\"mycompany-\", \"internal-\"]\n    )\n    is_valid, reason = protector.validate_version_constraint(\"mycompany-auth\", \"99.99.99\")\n    print(f\"Version check: {is_valid} - {reason}\")\n    detection = detect_dependency_confusion_attack(\"mycompany-auth\", \"99.99.99\", \"artifacts.mycompany.com\")\n    print(f\"Risk score: {detection['risk_score']}/100\")\n    print(f\"Recommendation: {detection['recommendation']}\") ```\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:13:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840822611","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIkZTg","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: jhaayushkumar\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:13:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840823118","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIkcCw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782803610668","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:13:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840823819","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIk5pA","author":{"login":"jhaayushkumar"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Testing dependency confusion fix submission:\n\n```python\nimport re\nimport sys\nfrom typing import Tuple\n\nclass DependencyConfusionProtector:\n    def __init__(self, private_registry=None, internal_namespaces=None):\n        self.private_registry = private_registry\n        self.internal_namespaces = internal_namespaces or []\n    \n    def is_internal_package(self, package_name):\n        if not self.internal_namespaces:\n            return False\n        package_lower = package_name.lower()\n        return any(package_lower.startswith(ns.lower()) for ns in self.internal_namespaces)\n    \n    def validate_version_constraint(self, package_name, version):\n        version_match = re.match(r'(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)', version)\n        if not version_match:\n            return False, \"Invalid format\"\n        major, minor, patch = map(int, version_match.groups())\n        if major >= 99 or minor >= 99:\n            return False, \"Suspicious version detected - possible dependency confusion attack\"\n        return True, \"Version validated\"\n    \n    def validate_package_source(self, package_name, source_url=None):\n        is_internal = self.is_internal_package(package_name)\n        if is_internal:\n            if not self.private_registry:\n                return False, \"No private registry configured\"\n            if source_url and self.private_registry not in source_url:\n                return False, \"Internal package from unauthorized source\"\n            return True, \"Authorized private registry\"\n        return True, \"Public package validated\"\n    \n    def generate_secure_pip_command(self, packages):\n        cmd = [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\"]\n        if self.private_registry:\n            cmd.extend([\"--index-url\", self.private_registry, \"--no-index\"])\n        cmd.extend(packages)\n        cmd.extend([\"--require-hashes\", \"--no-deps\"])\n        return cmd\n\ndef detect_dependency_confusion_attack(package_name, installed_version, expected_source):\n    alerts = []\n    risk_score = 0\n    version_match = re.match(r'(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)', installed_version)\n    if version_match:\n        major, minor, patch = map(int, version_match.groups())\n        if major >= 99:\n            alerts.append(f\"Major version {major} is suspiciously high\")\n            risk_score += 50\n        if minor >= 99:\n            alerts.append(f\"Minor version {minor} is suspiciously high\")\n            risk_score += 30\n    return {\n        \"package_name\": package_name,\n        \"version\": installed_version,\n        \"alerts\": alerts,\n        \"risk_score\": risk_score,\n        \"is_suspicious\": risk_score >= 50,\n        \"recommendation\": \"BLOCK AND INVESTIGATE\" if risk_score >= 50 else \"MONITOR\"\n    }\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    protector = DependencyConfusionProtector(\n        private_registry=\"https://artifacts.mycompany.com/pypi\",\n        internal_namespaces=[\"mycompany-\", \"internal-\"]\n    )\n    is_valid, reason = protector.validate_version_constraint(\"mycompany-auth\", \"99.99.99\")\n    print(f\"Version check: {is_valid} - {reason}\")\n    detection = detect_dependency_confusion_attack(\"mycompany-auth\", \"99.99.99\", \"artifacts.mycompany.com\")\n    print(f\"Risk score: {detection['risk_score']}/100\")\n    print(f\"Recommendation: {detection['recommendation']}\") ```\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:14:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840831396","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIk-mQ","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782803674607","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:14:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840832665","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIlZuw","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: jhaayushkumar\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:15:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840839611","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIIlerQ","author":{"login":"jhaayushkumar"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@zhangjiayang6835-cyber i had already starred the repo kindly confirm","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:15:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4840840877","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIJdPZQ","author":{"login":"bambooshadow-studio"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Dependency Confusion Fix\n\n```javascript\nconst crypto = require(\"crypto\");\n\nclass DependencyConfusionGuard {\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\n    this.allowedRegistry = opts.registry || \"https://registry.npmjs.org\";\n    this.internalPrefix = opts.internalPrefix || \"@internal/\";\n  }\n\n  validatePackageName(name, version) {\n    if (!name || typeof name !== \"string\") throw new Error(\"Invalid package name\");\n    if (name.startsWith(this.internalPrefix)) {\n      console.log(\"Verified internal package:\", name);\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  hashPackage(content) {\n    return crypto.createHash(\"sha256\").update(content).digest(\"hex\");\n  }\n\n  verifyIntegrity(name, content, expectedHash) {\n    const actual = this.hashPackage(content);\n    if (actual !== expectedHash) {\n      throw new Error(\"Integrity mismatch - possible dependency confusion: \" + name);\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { DependencyConfusionGuard };\n\n// Usage:\n// const guard = new DependencyConfusionGuard();\n// guard.validatePackageName(\"@internal/sdk\", \"1.0.0\");\n```\n\n**Fix explanation:** This utility prevents dependency confusion attacks by:\n1. Validating package names against known internal scope\n2. Providing SHA-256 integrity verification\n3. Rejecting packages that don't match expected hashes\n\n/bounty 25","createdAt":"2026-06-30T09:14:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4841754469","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIJdRsA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⏰ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: bambooshadow-studio\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 任务截止时间已过\n\n> 该任务已过期，无法再提交。","createdAt":"2026-06-30T09:14:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4841755056","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIJdUWw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782810881063","createdAt":"2026-06-30T09:14:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4841755739","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIJgwYA","author":{"login":"bambooshadow-studio"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Dependency Confusion Fix\n\n```javascript\nconst crypto = require(\"crypto\");\nclass DependencyConfusionGuard {\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\n    this.allowedRegistry = opts.registry || \"https://registry.npmjs.org\";\n    this.internalPrefix = opts.internalPrefix || \"@internal/\";\n  }\n  validatePackageName(name) {\n    if (!name || typeof name !== \"string\") throw new Error(\"Invalid\");\n    return true;\n  }\n  verifyIntegrity(name, content, hash) {\n    const a = crypto.createHash(\"sha256\").update(content).digest(\"hex\");\n    if (a !== hash) throw new Error(\"Mismatch: \" + name);\n    return true;\n  }\n}\nmodule.exports = { DependencyConfusionGuard };\n```\n\n/bounty 25","createdAt":"2026-06-30T09:21:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4841812064","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIJg0lQ","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-39-1782811306889","createdAt":"2026-06-30T09:21:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/39#issuecomment-4841813141","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIJhMuA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⏰ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: bambooshadow-studio\n**任务**: #39\n**原因**: 任务截止时间已过\n\n> 该任务已过期，无法再提交。","createdAt":"2026